v1" begin="00:22.470" end="00:23.730"><span begin="00:22.470" end="00:22.800">Money </span><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:23.130">just </span><span begin="00:23.130" end="00:23.220">for </span><span begin="00:23.220" end="00:23.730">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.730" end="00:25.830"><span begin="00:23.730" end="00:24.510">I </span><span begin="00:24.510" end="00:24.690">know </span><span begin="00:24.690" end="00:24.810">you </span><span begin="00:24.810" end="00:25.260">wanna </span><span begin="00:25.260" end="00:25.830">party</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.460" end="00:27.870"><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:26.812">Party </span><span begin="00:26.812" end="00:27.164">just </span><span begin="00:27.164" end="00:27.516">for </span><span begin="00:27.516" end="00:27.870">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.870" end="00:30.450"><span begin="00:27.870" end="00:28.710">Girl</span><span begin="00:28.710" end="00:28.710">, </span><span begin="00:28.710" end="00:28.800">you </span><span begin="00:28.800" end="00:29.040">got </span><span begin="00:29.040" end="00:29.160">me </span><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.580">dancin' </span><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:29.580">（</span><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:29.670">yeah</span><span begin="00:29.670" end="00:29.670">, </span><span begin="00:29.670" end="00:29.760">girl</span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:29.760">, </span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:29.820">you </span><span begin="00:29.820" end="00:30.150">got </span><span begin="00:30.150" end="00:30.210">me </span><span begin="00:30.210" end="00:30.450">dancin'</span><span begin="00:30.450" end="00:30.450">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.450" end="00:32.520"><span begin="00:30.450" end="00:30.720">Dance </span><span begin="00:30.720" end="00:30.810">and </span><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:31.050">shake </span><span begin="00:31.050" end="00:31.140">the </span><span begin="00:31.140" end="00:32.280">frame </span>