="00:49.440" end="00:49.530">you</span><span begin="00:49.530" end="00:49.530">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.530" end="00:50.730"><span begin="00:49.530" end="00:49.740">This </span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:49.860">is </span><span begin="00:49.860" end="00:50.730">America</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.360" end="00:53.340"><span begin="00:51.360" end="00:51.630">Don't </span><span begin="00:51.630" end="00:51.840">catch </span><span begin="00:51.840" end="00:51.930">you </span><span begin="00:51.930" end="00:52.350">slippin' </span><span begin="00:52.350" end="00:53.340">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.370" end="00:55.350"><span begin="00:53.370" end="00:53.640">Don't </span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:53.850">catch </span><span begin="00:53.850" end="00:53.940">you </span><span begin="00:53.940" end="00:54.360">slippin' </span><span begin="00:54.360" end="00:55.350">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.410" end="00:56.730"><span begin="00:55.410" end="00:55.650">Look </span><span begin="00:55.650" end="00:55.830">what </span><span begin="00:55.830" end="00:55.950">I'm </span><span begin="00:55.950" end="00:56.370">whippin' </span><span begin="00:56.370" end="00:56.730">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.360" end="00:59.370"><span begin="00:57.360" end="00:57.750">This </span><span begin="00:57.750" end="00:57.870">is </span><span begin="00:57.870" end="00:58.440">America </span><span begin="00:58.440" end="00:58.440">（</span><span begin="00:58.440" end="00:58.740">woo</span><span begin="00:58.740" end="00:59.370">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.370" end="01:01.350"><span begin="00:59.370" end="00:59.640">Don't </span><span begin="00:59.640" end="00:59.850">catch </span><span begin="00:59.850" end="00:59.910">you </span><span begin="00:59.910" end="01:00.360">slippin' </span><span begin="01:00.360" end="01:01.350">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.410" end="01:02.760"><span begin="01: